# Single company, no subdomains

This CRM runs as one company on the main domain.

- Do not add subdomain routing, `*.domain` hosts, or redirects to `{subdomain}.example.com`
- Resolve the company with `Company::current()` / `config('company.id')` (`COMPANY_ID` in `.env`)
- Build links with `url()` or named routes, never subdomain URL helpers
- `/admin/*` stays on the same host
